OL,5,G1330 Music Map
OL,6,     FAs Steve Reich turns 90, Sara
OL,7,     FMohr-Pietsch explores his
OL,8,     Fgroundbreaking minimalist work
OL,9,     FMusic for 18 Musicians, with
OL,10,     Fpieces by Bach, Debussy and
OL,11,     FPauline Oliveros along the way.
OL,12,G1500 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,13,     FRadio 3 marks the 90th birthday of
OL,14,     Fcomposer Steve Reich with
OL,15,     Fhighlights from a weekend of
OL,16,     Fconcerts brought to you live from
OL,17,     Fthe Glasshouse in Gateshead.
