OL,5,G1630 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe Steve Reich 90th birthday
OL,7,     Ftribute weekend from the
OL,8,     FGlasshouse International Centre of
OL,9,     FMusic in Gateshead continues with
OL,10,     Fperformances of some of Reich's
OL,11,     Fmost enduring music.
OL,12,G1800 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,13,     FLive from The Glasshouse, the BBC
OL,14,     FScottish Symphony Orchestra
OL,15,     Fcelebrates the music of Steve
OL,16,     FReich with four landmark works,
OL,17,     Fconducted by Colin Currie with
OL,18,     Fguitarist Bryce Dessner.
